    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Adam</strong>, a boy mourning the loss of his friend <strong>Sam</strong>. After a bitter wish for his <strong>parents</strong> to disappear, he now finds himself alone, <i>and determined to</i> <i>find them</i>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/81bb0a030501c9de9dd6dacd92a7e4b7.poster.avif?t=1751884436\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/81bb0a030501c9de9dd6dacd92a7e4b7.webm?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/81bb0a030501c9de9dd6dacd92a7e4b7.mp4?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Along the way</strong>, he meets the eerie yet gentle <strong>Paper-Cut Man</strong>, who offers to help. But the deeper <strong>Adam</strong> ventures, the more reality unravels. Whispers echo. Pages bleed. Who <i>really</i> is this mysterious <strong><i>friend</i></strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/df3f9d23db85f5e38a823d7ceaf08f60.poster.avif?t=1751884436\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/df3f9d23db85f5e38a823d7ceaf08f60.webm?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/df3f9d23db85f5e38a823d7ceaf08f60.mp4?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story about <strong>grief</strong>, <strong>guilt</strong>, <strong>and the strange ways the mind tries to protect itself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes, <i>the sharpest cuts are the ones you don't remember making</i>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/4e02068fca64554ea50547156d71e17c.poster.avif?t=1751884436\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/4e02068fca64554ea50547156d71e17c.webm?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/4e02068fca64554ea50547156d71e17c.mp4?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that seems off in ways he can\u2019t explain, Adam sees a familiar face, one he isn\u2019t sure he\u2019s ever really known.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/ceb498f3234879974daaf81539ac147e.poster.avif?t=1751884436\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/ceb498f3234879974daaf81539ac147e.webm?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/ceb498f3234879974daaf81539ac147e.mp4?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
