mind tries to protect itself</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And sometimes, <i>the sharpest cuts are the ones you don't remember making</i>.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/4e02068fca64554ea50547156d71e17c.poster.avif?t=1751884436\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/4e02068fca64554ea50547156d71e17c.webm?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/4e02068fca64554ea50547156d71e17c.mp4?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world that seems off in ways he can\u2019t explain, Adam sees a familiar face, one he isn\u2019t sure he\u2019s ever really known.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/ceb498f3234879974daaf81539ac147e.poster.avif?t=1751884436\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/ceb498f3234879974daaf81539ac147e.webm?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811980/extras/ceb498f3234879974daaf81539ac147e.mp4?t=1751884436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
